            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "hlmw"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is fast quick and easy. A Great alternative if you don't have plain yogurt to make Tatziki. I added a little bit of mayo with olive oil and a teaspoon of minced garlice. I didn't have fresh dill so I used dried. I also used reduced fat sour cream. I used this to top the Spinach and Feta Turkey burger (recipe can be found on this site) So good!",
            "datePublished": "2010-09-19T13:58:38.790Z"
          },
          {
