            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BABYBOOBEAR"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It's OK; but it is just an Americanized version of the Greek Tzatziki - which uses Greek Yogurt, cucumber (Peeled, seeded and finely chopped), garlic, dill, and a tad of XVOO.",
            "datePublished": "2009-09-19T10:38:04.133Z"
