            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "GuineaPig"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Excellent recipe. I made this for work and 2 people asked me for the recipe and 3 people can't stop talking about it. Instead of grating and extracting the juice, I seeded the cucumber and chopped the cucumber into small pieces. This way, you could still taste the cucumber. It is a very refreshing dip!!",
            "datePublished": "2008-08-19T05:37:01.597Z"
          },
          {
