            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Carrieh82"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is delicious for sure &amp; Perfect for summer. I added freshly ground pepper and garlic powder and also used sea salt. Don't skimp on the lemon juice, it adds such a nice *zing* I took another's advice to squeeze the shredded (unpeeled) cucumber between paper towels and this worked perfectly to keep it from getting too runny. I served this with carrots, celery and cucumber slices. Yummy!! I'll make this often. Thanks!",
            "datePublished": "2009-08-11T04:52:54.157Z"
